msgctxt "76"
msgid "Kiryu-san..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid "Hm? The fuck are you, pretty boy?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid ""
"You don't know? That's the fourth chairman of the Tojo Clan,\r\n"
"Kazuma Kiryu-san!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid "Hmmm?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid "Oh... Ohhh! I know you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid "Then you'll know to back off!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid "Open those ears real good, Fourth Chairman-han."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid ""
"I dunno what you're strollin' in here for, but lemme set\r\n"
"the record straight."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid ""
"Me and these gentlemen? We're just havin' a friendly little chitchat. Not a "
"suspicious thing about it, cross my heart n' hope to die."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid "So why don't you go runnin' along home?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid "Kazuki. What's going on?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid "This guy came in and started saying he wanted to buy the club."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid "Who are you, anyway?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid ""
"Name's Hasebe, captain of the Nishikiyama Family. Y'know,\r\n"
"the one wrestin' control of this whole damn city."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid "What?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid ""
"So look, we just wanna borrow your pal's club for a bit.\r\n"
"We're playin' nice now... but you don't wanna see what\r\n"
"happens when we don't."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid "Why do you need the club?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid "Well that just doesn't even deserve an answer. Now scram, pal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid "So whaddya say?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid "300 mil's a damn mighty pile o' cash. As I think you can see."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid ""
"And hey, it's just one measly month. That time'll fly by\r\n"
"quicker than a bat outta hell."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid "...I think I know what you want it for."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid ""
"You're going to turn this place into your base of operations\r\n"
"for a yakuza war."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "352"
msgid ""
"Heh. Guess ya don't survive this long in Kamurocho without\r\n"
"knowin' how its shadier side operates, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid "I also know who your target is: the Kazama Family."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "376"
msgid "What!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "388"
msgid "Heh. You're one smart cookie, buddy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "400"
msgid ""
"But not smart enough to accept our offer. We got other ways of convincin' "
"if ya need that little push."
msgstr ""

